# Kbuild file for the Pinefeat CEF168 lens driver (cef168.c, upstream
# https://github.com/pinefeat/cef168, pinned by cinemate-install.sh).
#
# Upstream ships Makefile.template instead, which its configure.sh copies to
# Makefile together with sensor overlay patching. DKMS only needs the one
# line below, and a file called Kbuild takes precedence over a Makefile in
# the same directory, so nothing from upstream is modified.
